meta {
  name: Accounts
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Managing other super admins. Owners only (`accounts.manage`). Every write
  needs `reason` and a fresh `totp_code`. Rules: at least one active owner
  always remains; nobody changes their own role, disables themselves or resets
  their own two-factor authentication. The command-line equivalents are the
  `super-admin:*` artisan commands.
}
